    <item>
      <title>Node.js 的 Event Loop (事件輪詢)到底在做什麼？</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202108/nodejs-event-loop/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 10 Aug 2021 16:13:57 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202108/nodejs-event-loop/</guid>
